# This bundle is verified by BYTE identity: verify-patch.mjs asserts that the
# persona parsed out of cordis.patch.yml equals persona.txt exactly. Git's
# autocrlf would rewrite both files on checkout and silently break that check on
# every Windows clone, so line endings are pinned to LF for the whole repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary if anyone ever adds artwork.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
